5generate_sampleEv\r\n>>> defined as () -> void in bin/obj/servers/libservers.web.template_release.wasm32.a(scu_servers_audio.gen.web.template_release.wasm32.o)\r\n>>> defined as (i32, i32) -> void in lto.tmp\r\n\r\nwasm-ld: warning: function signature mismatch: _ZNK9Texture3D18create_placeholderEv\r\n>>> defined as () -> void in bin/obj/scene/libscene.web.template_release.wasm32.a(scu_scene_resources_6.gen.web.template_release.wasm32.o)\r\n>>> defined as (i32, i32) -> void in lto.tmp\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2783848097/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2800632845","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105080#issuecomment-2800632845","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105080","id":2800632845,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6m7kQN","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-14T06:45:19Z","updated_at":"2025-04-14T06:45:19Z","body":"I placed the basisu parameters in a struct to improve readability.\r\n\r\nAnd I'd like to enable zstd by default to actually make basisu disk size smaller as described in [docs](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.html#compress-mode)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2800632845/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2837894160","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105080#issuecomment-2837894160","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105080","id":2837894160,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pJtQQ","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-29T08:15:19Z","updated_at":"2025-04-29T08:15:19Z","body":"The Basisu settings currently appear at all times in the import dock, they should only show up when the compression mode is set to \"BasisUniversal\":\r\n![basisusettings](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8a3b4801-8e0c-4b6e-a85b-0c75e77d3ce9)\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2837894160/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2842091645","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105080#issuecomment-2842091645","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105080","id":2842091645,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pZuB9","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-30T14:01:12Z","updated_at":"2025-04-30T14:01:12Z","body":"Tested on Windows 10 desktop and web, it works as expected:\r\n| Desktop | Web |\r\n|-----------|------|\r\n| ![desktop](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/068bec48-6bfd-41ae-988f-d363f1b4f305) | ![web](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6b3aa366-be89-452d-b57f-38675ca5e437) |\r\n\r\nEach texture, including the lightmap and shadowmask, is compressed as BasisU. The exported .pck is 9mb with supercompression, and 17mb without. Better results can likely be achieved by tweaking the settings\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2842091645/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2843652106","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105080#issuecomment-2843652106","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105080","id":2843652106,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pfrAK","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-30T23:14:44Z","updated_at":"2025-04-30T23:15:15Z","body":"In terms of UX, this adds a lot of import options when Basis Universal is chosen as a compression mode. It makes the already lengthy texture import options even longer.\r\n\r\nI'm thinking these should be project settings instead (like https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104571 does). Are there situations where you want specific textures only to import faster, but still use VRAM compression (instead of Lossless or VRAM Uncompressed while you're iterating on an asset)?\r\n\r\n*Maybe* the UASTC level could be configurable per-texture, but that's probably the extent where I'd allow per-texture configuration.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2843652106/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2843873381","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105080#issuecomment-2843873381","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105080","id":2843873381,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pghBl","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-01T01:27:04Z","updated_at":"2025-05-01T01:46:01Z","body":"The effects of supercompression with different textures vary greatly as my previously test shows. Generally, you would want to use rdo and more aggressive compression for larger textures, but this is not suitable for all textures since it increase encoding times.\r\n\r\nIn my opinion, adding these options is not a issue for UX, because they are grouped together and placed at the end, and they are only visible in the basisu mode.\r\n\r\nWhat I'm a bit concerned about is whether these options are stable. Not sure if these will change with future updates of basisu. Maybe we should only provide some presets regarding quality and size.\r\n\r\nBy the way, ~ours ResourceFormatKTX doesn't transcode basis universal textures. If we support loading basisu KTX2 files,~ users can use the basisu cli tool as an alternative to customize compression parameters. I will take a look.\r\n\r\nEdit: ktx2 loader supports transcoding basisu textures, but not native srgb textures. basisu tool uses srgb  by default. Just needs `basisu -linear -uastc `","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2843873381/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2843997278","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105080#issuecomment-2843997278","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105080","id":2843997278,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pg_Re","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-01T03:25:32Z","updated_at":"2025-05-01T04:50:42Z","body":">Maybe the UASTC level could be configurable per-texture, but that's probably the extent where I'd allow per-texture configuration.\r\n\r\nUASTC level mainly controls the quality and has little impact on the size (Higher quality even slightly increases the file size).\r\n\r\nI might prefer to only remain the \"uastc level\" and \"rdo quality loss\" in import options( and automatically disable rdo when the rdo quality loss is approximately 0), as the other options have a relatively small impact and the default values are fine.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2843997278/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2844353517","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105080#issuecomment-2844353517","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105080","id":2844353517,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6piWPt","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-01T08:12:00Z","updated_at":"2025-05-01T08:12:00Z","body":"> > Maybe the UASTC level could be configurable per-texture, but that's probably the extent where I'd allow per-texture configuration.\r\n> \r\n> UASTC level mainly controls the quality and has little impact on the size (Higher quality even slightly increases the file size).\r\n> \r\n> I might prefer to only remain the \"uastc level\" and \"rdo quality loss\" in import options( and automatically disable rdo when the rdo quality loss is approximately 0), as the other options have a relatively small impact and the default values are fine.\r\n\r\nI agree with this, the level of aggressiveness with which RDO affects different textures highly varies depending on their type. For example, normal maps are highly sensitive to RDO, while artifacts on diffuse or ORM are much less noticeable. RDO also has the biggest influence on the resulting file size, so it makes sense for it to be exposed per-texture","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2844353517/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2844367269","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105080#issuecomment-2844367269","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105080","id":2844367269,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6piZml","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-01T08:22:59Z","updated_at":"2025-05-01T08:22:59Z","body":"Could the `Basis Universal` settings be moved next to the `Compress` category? I think it would be more intuitive, since these options are related:\r\n\r\n![basisuproposal](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ce4fde4b-a9c5-46a8-b322-c43e73085ba2)\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/28443672